WEBVTT

00:02:30.087 --> 00:02:33.598
The very same year
I first learned about all this,

00:02:33.622 --> 00:02:37.225
leaders from across the globe
came together in Paris

00:02:37.249 --> 00:02:43.055
to decide on the common target to limit
global warming to below two degrees.

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:45.376
Pictures went around the world,

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.885
and I was told that history
was made that day.

00:02:48.949 --> 00:02:50.505
How relieving, right?

00:02:52.358 --> 00:02:53.519
Except ...

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:57.806
something didn't quite
work out about this.

00:02:59.314 --> 00:03:02.132
After this agreement was signed,